        "title": "The Matrix Becomes Overwhelming",
        "description": "Visible structure could become visual noise, increase cognitive load, and make ordinary actions feel like graph administration.",
        "likelihood": "high",
        "impact": "high",
        "mitigation": "Make authored surfaces, semantic zoom, progressive disclosure, and direct manipulation primary. The graph should reveal itself only at the resolution useful for the current action.",
        "definitionKey": "idea-risk",
